[
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "欢迎来到KC桌面。今天我们用一份最新\n研报，拆一个值得继续跟踪的问题。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 6.873,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "KC桌面",
      "研报"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "最近有一份关于Workday的研报，\n核心是讲它如何在AI时代找到新的增长\n路径。",
    "start": 7.233,
    "end": 14.153,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Workday",
      "AI",
      "增长路径"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "你觉得这份报告最值得关注的点是什么？",
    "start": 14.513,
    "end": 17.81,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "报告"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "我觉得最核心的是，Workday提出\n了一个叫“无头企业软件”的愿景。简单\n说，就是不再只是卖座位数，",
    "start": 18.17,
    "end": 28.154,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "无头企业软件",
      "卖座位数"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "而是通过AI代理、平台和API三种方\n式来变现。",
    "start": 28.514,
    "end": 34.273,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "AI代理",
      "平台",
      "API"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "无头企业软件？这个听起来有点抽象。它\n到底要解决什么问题？",
    "start": 34.633,
    "end": 39.695,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "无头企业软件",
      "抽象"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "传统的企业软件，比如HR或者财务系统\n，是按人头收费的。但Workday在\n思考，",
    "start": 40.055,
    "end": 47.439,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "HR",
      "财务系统",
      "按人头收费"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "如果未来AI可以替代很多人工操作，那\n增长从哪里来？所以他们提出了“熄灯式\n”的财务和HR，",
    "start": 47.799,
    "end": 56.251,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "AI",
      "增长",
      "熄灯式"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "就是让流程自动化到几乎不需要人工干预\n。",
    "start": 56.611,
    "end": 60.698,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "流程自动化",
      "人工干预"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以这意味着Workday在主动颠覆\n自己的商业模式？",
    "start": 61.058,
    "end": 65.469,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "颠覆",
      "商业模式"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "没错。他们现在有三大变现路径。第一是\n卖自己的AI代理，直接帮客户实现自动\n化。",
    "start": 65.829,
    "end": 73.771,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "三大变现路径",
      "AI代理",
      "自动化"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "第二是让客户在Workday平台上自\n己搭建AI应用。第三是提供底层API\n，让第三方开发者来构建生态。",
    "start": 74.131,
    "end": 84.394,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Workday平台",
      "AI应用",
      "底层API"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "听起来有点像从卖产品变成卖平台。那这\n份报告里有没有提到，这个转型目前进展\n如何？",
    "start": 84.754,
    "end": 93.206,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "卖产品",
      "卖平台",
      "转型"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "有个数字很关键。报告里提到，Work\nday的AI相关年化经常性收入已经达\n到5亿美元，",
    "start": 93.566,
    "end": 102.343,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "5亿美元",
      "年化经常性收入"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "占新增净年化经常性收入的30%以上。\n这说明他们的AI产品已经开始产生实质\n性的收入贡献了。",
    "start": 102.703,
    "end": 112.13,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "新增净年化经常性收入",
      "30%",
      "AI产品"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "5亿美元？那确实不是小数目。不过，我\n注意到报告里也提到，",
    "start": 112.49,
    "end": 117.645,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "5亿美元"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "Workday的核心订阅收入增长其实\n稳定在12%左右。这是不是说明老业务\n在放缓？",
    "start": 118.005,
    "end": 125.9,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "核心订阅收入",
      "12%",
      "老业务"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，这正是报告要强调的。AI收入在增\n长，但传统按座位收费的业务增长确实在\n放缓。所以，这些新的变现路径，",
    "start": 126.26,
    "end": 139.82,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "AI收入",
      "按座位收费",
      "变现路径"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "正是用来对冲老业务增长压力的关键。",
    "start": 140.18,
    "end": 143.524,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "对冲",
      "增长压力"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那除此之外，报告里还有没有提到其他值\n得关注的战略动作？",
    "start": 143.884,
    "end": 148.76,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "战略动作"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "有。Workday还宣布进入了IT服\n务管理这个新市场。这个动作很有意思，",
    "start": 149.12,
    "end": 155.576,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "IT服务管理",
      "新市场"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "因为它是在利用自己在员工生命周期管理\n上的经验，去拓展更大的市场空间。",
    "start": 155.936,
    "end": 163.598,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "市场空间"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以，这份报告的核心结论是什么？读者\n应该怎么看待Workday？",
    "start": 163.958,
    "end": 169.113,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "核心结论",
      "Workday"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告认为，虽然这一季度的业绩超出预期\n，但股价能否持续重估，取决于他们能否\n成功推出自研的AI代理，",
    "start": 169.473,
    "end": 180.433,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "业绩超出预期"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "以及“无头”和ITSM产品能否找到市\n场认可。未来12个月，很可能是一个转\n型过渡年。",
    "start": 180.793,
    "end": 189.523,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "转型过渡年"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "也就是说，现在看好坏参半。那报告里有\n没有哪些问题是没有完全展开的？",
    "start": 189.883,
    "end": 196.199,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "好坏参半"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "有两个悬念。第一，Workday的“\n无头”模式具体怎么定价，报告没有细说\n。第二，他们进入ITSM市场后，",
    "start": 196.559,
    "end": 208.216,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "定价",
      "ITSM市场"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "会面临什么样的竞争格局？这些内容在完\n整报告里有更深入的分析。",
    "start": 208.576,
    "end": 215.077,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "会面临什么样",
      "的竞争格局"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "好的，那如果想了解更多细节，比如具体\n的定价模型和竞争分析，应该去哪里看？",
    "start": 215.437,
    "end": 222.961,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "好的",
      "那如果想了解"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，这些都在完整版的研报里。如果你对\n这份报告感兴趣，可以加入我们的社群，\n或者直接联系我们获取完整版本。",
    "start": 223.321,
    "end": 234.745,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "社群",
      "完整版本"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "我们也会在后续的播客里继续拆解这些悬\n念。",
    "start": 235.105,
    "end": 238.681,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "播客",
      "悬念"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "好，那我们就先聊到这里。感谢你今天的\n分享。",
    "start": 239.041,
    "end": 243.36,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "那我们就先聊",
      "到这里"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
